  "content": "<p>September is here, which means traditional festivities, delicious food, and plenty of time to work on your latest projects! Check out our lineup of workshops, meetups, and community sessions coming up this month.</p><p>We also host Open Community Days every Thursday at 18:00.</p><p>For full details and event registration, visit munichmakerlab.de/events</p><p><a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/hackerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>hackerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/openworkshop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>openworkshop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MunichMakerLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MunichMakerLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MuMaLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MuMaLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativquartier\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativquartier</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativlabor\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativlabor</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/DIYMunich\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DIYMunich</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/oktoberfest\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>oktoberfest</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/septemberevents\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>septemberevents</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/munichevents\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>munichevents</span></a></p>",
